# === Rust / Cargo / Tauri ===
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
# Cargo.lock is kept tracked deliberately — this is an app, not a library,
# so committing it keeps builds reproducible across machines.

# Tauri build output
src-tauri/WixTools/
